{"seq":2,"slug":"channel-tier-incentive-review","title":"授权商分级、激励与淘汰机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-map-channel-price-enforcement/channel-health-governance/channel-tier-incentive-review","wordCount":2943,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"授权商分级-激励与淘汰机制\">授权商分级、激励与淘汰机制</h1><p>一个品牌把 MAP 政策写进合同、把价格爬虫跑起来，往往仍会发现违规量不降反升——原因通常不在监测，而在<strong>分级与激励结构本身在鼓励违规</strong>。当等级只看进货额、返利只按出货量结算时，经销商超量进货冲等级、再把多出的货低价甩给灰市，是这套规则下的理性选择。本文讨论 MAP 治理闭环里决定长期效果的一环：如何设计授权商的分级维度、激励结构和淘汰阶梯，让&quot;守规矩&quot;在单位经济上比&quot;破价窜货&quot;更划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分级制度是资源分配器-不是荣誉榜\">核心概念：分级制度是资源分配器，不是荣誉榜</h2><p>品牌常把渠道分级当成表彰体系——年度颁奖、金色 logo、官网列名。但在 MAP 与窜货治理语境里，分级的本质是<strong>约束资源的分配器</strong>：等级决定了经销商能拿到多少货、以什么价格拿货、能进入哪些市场、以及违约时品牌给它几次改正机会。</p>\n<p>分级制度必须同时给出可累积的收益与可收回的权益。判断其是否服务于 MAP 治理，可用三个问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>等级判定里有没有<strong>合规与终端销售</strong>相关的维度？只考核进货额的记分卡会直接奖励压货。</li>\n<li>高等级权益里有没有<strong>可被收回</strong>的部分？不可收回的权益只是成本，不是杠杆。</li>\n<li>降级与淘汰的触发路径是否比升级路径更具体？模糊的淘汰条款在争议中无法执行。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[授权商行为数据&lt;br/&gt;出货/终端销量/合规/服务] --&gt; B[加权记分卡]&#10;    B --&gt; C{分数区间判定}&#10;    C --&gt;|高分| D[高阶权益&lt;br/&gt;更低进货价/优先供货/区域独占]&#10;    C --&gt;|中分| E[基础权益]&#10;    C --&gt;|低分| F[降级: 权益回收]&#10;    F --&gt; G{整改期内是否恢复}&#10;    G --&gt;|恢复| E&#10;    G --&gt;|未恢复| H[停供/终止授权]&#10;    D --&gt; I[下一周期复核]&#10;    E --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; J[合同终止 + 存量库存处置]&#10;    I --&gt; B\">graph TD\n    A[授权商行为数据&lt;br/&gt;出货/终端销量/合规/服务] --&gt; B[加权记分卡]\n    B --&gt; C{分数区间判定}\n    C --&gt;|高分| D[高阶权益&lt;br/&gt;更低进货价/优先供货/区域独占]\n    C --&gt;|中分| E[基础权益]\n    C --&gt;|低分| F[降级: 权益回收]\n    F --&gt; G{整改期内是否恢复}\n    G --&gt;|恢复| E\n    G --&gt;|未恢复| H[停供/终止授权]\n    D --&gt; I[下一周期复核]\n    E --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; J[合同终止 + 存量库存处置]\n    I --&gt; B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>典型准入条件</th>\n<th>价格下限位置</th>\n<th>关键权益</th>\n<th>违约时的首要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>战略级</td>\n<td>终端销售达标 + 全周期零重大违规 + 服务审计通过</td>\n<td>贴近基准价，促销豁免额度最大</td>\n<td>区域/品类独占、最低进货价、联合营销预算</td>\n<td>独占权先行收回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心级</td>\n<td>终端销售达标 + 违规可闭环整改</td>\n<td>基准价小幅下浮</td>\n<td>优先供货、MDF 支持、新品首销</td>\n<td>降级并取消首销资格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础级</td>\n<td>有授权合同 + 无未决重大违规</td>\n<td>标准批发价</td>\n<td>常规供货、售后支持</td>\n<td>停新品配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观察级</td>\n<td>有未整改违规或处于整改期</td>\n<td>维持标准价，无豁免</td>\n<td>仅保底供货</td>\n<td>整改期不通过即终止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未授权</td>\n<td>无合同关系</td>\n<td>无下限</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>只能走举证与法律途径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表与 <a href=\"../map-policy-channel/authorized-channel-price-tiers\">授权渠道体系与价格梯度模型</a> 的梯度是同一套结构：<strong>等级决定梯度档位，梯度档位决定价格下限</strong>。两者必须由同一份主数据驱动，否则会出现&quot;等级升了但价格配置没跟着变&quot;的错配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分级维度设计-合规与终端销售必须进记分卡\">分级维度设计：合规与终端销售必须进记分卡</h2><p>以进货额作为唯一分级维度，是窜货的结构性诱因。若返利额度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 按进货量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 结算且单位返利随量递增，则经销商单位净成本为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>net</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>wholesale</mtext><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>q</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C*{\\text{net}}(q) = P*{\\text{wholesale}} - \\frac{R(q)}{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">wholesale</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(q)/q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 单调上升，超额进货再整批转出就能把&quot;低价甩货&quot;变成正收益，这正是 <a href=\"../diversion-graymarket/diversion-causes-gray-market\">窜货成因与灰色市场结构</a> 所说的&quot;越冲量越可能窜货&quot;。要拆掉这个动机，记分卡输入必须从&quot;进货额&quot;换成&quot;终端销售 + 合规表现&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\sum*{i=1}^{n} w_i \\cdot s_i, \\qquad \\sum*{i=1}^{n} w_i = 1, \\; s_i \\in [0,100]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>各维度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 归一化到 0–100。一套面向 MAP 治理的维度集通常包含六项：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>建议权重</th>\n<th>治理含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>终端销售（sell-through）</td>\n<td>POS/平台订单对账</td>\n<td>30%–40%</td>\n<td>替代进货额，消掉压货动机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAP 合规率</td>\n<td>价格监测系统</td>\n<td>20%–30%</td>\n<td>直接挂钩本文主题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溯源合规（批号/序列号闭环）</td>\n<td>出库扫码与收货核销</td>\n<td>10%–15%</td>\n<td>为窜货举证提供证据链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务能力（陈列/售后/交付时效）</td>\n<td>审计与消费者反馈</td>\n<td>10%–15%</td>\n<td>保护线下渠道的服务投入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格梯度执行（豁免内使用）</td>\n<td>促销报备与结算数据</td>\n<td>5%–10%</td>\n<td>防止豁免窗口被滥用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>财务与账期健康度</td>\n<td>结算记录</td>\n<td>5%–10%</td>\n<td>排除不可持续的合作方</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>真实的伙伴计划佐证了多维化趋势。微软 2022 年 10 月把 Microsoft Partner Network 更名为 Microsoft Cloud Partner Program，把原 Gold/Silver 徽章制改成基于 <strong>partner capability score</strong> 的&quot;Solutions Partner&quot;认定，分数由 performance、skilling、customer success 三类子分值合成，达到 100 分制的 70 分阈值才获认定（<a href=\"https://partner.microsoft.com/\">partner.microsoft.com</a>）；AWS Partner Network 的 Select / Advanced / Premier 三级同样把营收、认证人数与客户上线案例并列考察（<a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/partners/programs/\">aws.amazon.com/partners</a>）。</p>\n<p>落地时有两个易错点。<strong>合规率的分母口径</strong>：若以&quot;被发现违规的次数&quot;为分母，监测覆盖面越大分数越难看，应以&quot;被监测 SKU-渠道组合数&quot;为分母。<strong>冷启动</strong>：无历史终端数据的新经销商给 90–180 天过渡档，先按合规率与溯源合规计分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等级权益与激励结构-让守规矩更划算\">等级权益与激励结构：让守规矩更划算</h2><p>分级只有配上经济后果才有约束力。权益清单需要两类：<strong>增量型激励</strong>（做得好能多拿）与<strong>可收回型权益</strong>（做得差会失去）——前者制造拉力，后者制造推力，缺任一边都会失衡。</p>\n<p>最重要的一项增量激励是把返利结算口径从 sell-in 改成 sell-through，把品牌从&quot;卖给经销商&quot;变成&quot;和经销商一起卖给消费者&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>st</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>sell-in</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>sell-through</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R*{\\text{st}} = r \\cdot \\min(q*{\\text{sell-in}}, q\\_{\\text{sell-through}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">st</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sell-in</span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sell-through</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取两者较小值，让压货不再产生返利。其副作用是品牌要承担真实终端数据的对账成本，因此它强制品牌接入 POS 或平台订单数据，客观上也为 <a href=\"../map-monitoring-enforcement/price-crawl-monitoring-system\">全渠道价格采集与监测系统架构</a> 提供了同一套数据底座。</p>\n<p>可收回型权益的设计要点是<strong>层级越高，可收回的越多</strong>。区域独占、品类独占、最低进货价、联合营销（MDF/co-op）预算都是品牌授予的排他性资源，回收成本低、杠杆强，适合作为降级的首要代价。相比之下，罚款是最差的工具：它在很多法域有反垄断与合同可执行性风险，对边际行为几乎没有改变。</p>\n<p>激励设计的最终判据只有一个：<strong>同一批货，合规卖出的期望净收益是否高于破价窜货</strong>。设合规路径净利润 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、违规路径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、被发现概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、发现后的权益损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，则违规成立的条件是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-p)\\,\\pi_v + p\\,(\\pi_v - L) &gt; \\pi_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>品牌能直接控制的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 由监测覆盖面与溯源能力决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 由激励结构决定。这也解释了分级与监测为何必须同步——提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 却没有对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，只是让违约更容易被抓；加码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 却抓不到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，权益损失永远不会触发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"淘汰机制-降级-停供-终止的三级阶梯\">淘汰机制：降级、停供、终止的三级阶梯</h2><p>淘汰不是一次性删除动作，而是<strong>证据完备、步骤可复现</strong>的阶梯。直接终止授权往往引发库存回购、售后责任、区域市场真空等连带后果，且在很多法域需要合同明确约定终止条件。阶梯化的另一个作用是把&quot;威慑&quot;与&quot;执行&quot;分开：多数经销商的纠偏发生在降级通知发出时，真正的终止是少数。</p>\n<p>三级阶梯：<strong>降级</strong>——记分卡低于阈值或单次重大违规，收回部分高阶权益并进入观察档；<strong>停供</strong>——整改期满未恢复，暂停新品配额或供货，但保留合同关系与售后义务；<strong>终止</strong>——连续多个周期未恢复，或涉及假货、大规模跨法域窜货，终止授权并启动存量处置。三级与 <a href=\"../map-policy-channel/map-agreement-breach-handling\">MAP 协议违约与处置阶梯</a>、<a href=\"../map-monitoring-enforcement/enforcement-escalation-appeals\">违规升级与申诉流程</a> 共享同一份违规台账。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>对应级别</th>\n<th>通知方式</th>\n<th>整改期</th>\n<th>未通过后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>记分卡低于降级线</td>\n<td>降级</td>\n<td>季度记分卡送达</td>\n<td>一个考核周期</td>\n<td>进入观察档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次重大 MAP 违规（大面积破价）</td>\n<td>降级</td>\n<td>违规通知 + 证据包</td>\n<td>30–60 天</td>\n<td>收回独占与首销权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溯源无法闭环且拒不整改</td>\n<td>停供</td>\n<td>正式整改函</td>\n<td>60–90 天</td>\n<td>暂停新品配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确认参与假货或系统性窜货</td>\n<td>加速终止</td>\n<td>合同终止通知</td>\n<td>不适用或极短</td>\n<td>终止授权 + 法律追究</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>财务违约（长期欠款）</td>\n<td>停供→终止</td>\n<td>结算通知</td>\n<td>按合同账期</td>\n<td>终止并追偿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>流程上有四条硬约束：<strong>证据先于处罚</strong>（降级与停供必须附可核验证据，规范见 <a href=\"../map-monitoring-enforcement/violation-detection-evidence\">违规检测与证据固化</a>，缺证据链的处罚在申诉中极易被推翻）；<strong>通知可送达</strong>（跨境合作的送达地址、语言与电子送达方式须在合同约定）；<strong>整改期对称</strong>（给大客户的整改期不应长于给小客户）；<strong>终止配套存量处置</strong>（回购、退货、售后承接与区域过渡方案须预先写明，避免终止变成品牌自身的运营事故）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据与自动化-分级引擎的落地字段与节奏\">数据与自动化：分级引擎的落地字段与节奏</h2><p>把上述规则做成可运行的系统，需要的不是复杂算法，而是一份稳定的分级主数据加固定节奏的复核任务。分级结果应当<strong>可解释、可复算</strong>：经销商能看到每一项分值及数据出处，这是申诉能运转的前提。</p>\n<p>核心实体是经销商档案，字段至少包含 <code>dealer_id</code>、<code>tier_current</code>、<code>score_components</code>、<code>weights_version</code>（权重版本，保证历史可复算）、<code>violation_ledger_ref</code>、<code>traceability_status</code>、<code>remediation_deadline</code>。权重与阈值单独版本化，调整时生成新版本号而非原地覆盖，使一年前的判定仍可复算自证。</p>\n<p>复核通常按季度跑，重大违规走事件驱动触发，流程有三个设计点：<strong>升降级不对称</strong>——升级要求&quot;无未决违规&quot;，降级只要分数触线即执行；<strong>快照优先于现值</strong>——每次复核落一份不可变记分卡快照，历史争议只查快照；<strong>申诉入口内建</strong>——降级通知必须附申诉路径与时限，由独立于销售部门的角色裁定。</p>\n<p>最后是组织前提。分级与淘汰在生产层面是数据系统，在组织层面是一次<strong>销售部门让渡裁量权</strong>的安排：当渠道经理可以凭关系为大客户豁免降级时，记分卡立刻失效。落地时必须确定三件事——谁拥有规则修改权、谁拥有降级的执行权、谁拥有申诉的裁定权，且三者不应是同一批人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>授权商分级、激励与淘汰是 MAP 治理从&quot;抓违规&quot;走向&quot;改动机&quot;的一环。<strong>分级维度决定行为方向</strong>：只要进货额仍是等级的主导维度，压货与窜货就是理性选择；把终端销售与合规率放进记分卡，动机才开始转向。<strong>合规必须被定价</strong>：用可收回的高阶权益抬高期望损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、用监测与溯源抬高被发现概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，两者同步才让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-p)\\pi_v + p(\\pi_v - L) &gt; \\pi_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不再成立。<strong>淘汰要走阶梯</strong>：降级、停供、终止配合证据、送达、对称整改期与存量处置。<strong>制度成败取决于权力配置</strong>：规则修改权、降级执行权、申诉裁定权三权分置，是记分卡不被关系侵蚀的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"授权商分级、激励与淘汰机制","id":"授权商分级-激励与淘汰机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分级制度是资源分配器，不是荣誉榜","id":"核心概念-分级制度是资源分配器-不是荣誉榜"},{"level":2,"text":"分级维度设计：合规与终端销售必须进记分卡","id":"分级维度设计-合规与终端销售必须进记分卡"},{"level":2,"text":"等级权益与激励结构：让守规矩更划算","id":"等级权益与激励结构-让守规矩更划算"},{"level":2,"text":"淘汰机制：降级、停供、终止的三级阶梯","id":"淘汰机制-降级-停供-终止的三级阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"数据与自动化：分级引擎的落地字段与节奏","id":"数据与自动化-分级引擎的落地字段与节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"渠道健康指标体系与度量模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-map-channel-price-enforcement/channel-health-governance/channel-health-metrics"},"next":{"title":"治理复盘、合规审计与风险台账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-map-channel-price-enforcement/channel-health-governance/governance-review-compliance-audit"}}